{"name": "Cropia", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Cropia, you settle in a peaceful countryside where fertile soil, lively wildlife, and a welcoming town await. You\u2019ll build your own farm and ranch while contributing to the growth of the community around you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf3e <strong>Farm &amp; Harvest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cultivate fertile land with a variety of crops and watch your farm grow. Arrange your fields, expand your farmland, and create a space that reflects your own farming style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/50804ff7989a52aabe6b49ccdbd03931.poster.avif?t=1786616929\" width=\"610\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/50804ff7989a52aabe6b49ccdbd03931.webm?t=1786616929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/50804ff7989a52aabe6b49ccdbd03931.mp4?t=1786616929\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc11 <strong>Raise &amp; Care</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take care of animals ranging from chickens to larger livestock, ensuring they are fed and comfortable. In return, they provide valuable products and add life and charm to your farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/2b3d0907196d8330b07ed7c63f30d80e.poster.avif?t=1786616929\" width=\"610\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/2b3d0907196d8330b07ed7c63f30d80e.webm?t=1786616929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/2b3d0907196d8330b07ed7c63f30d80e.mp4?t=1786616929\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfa3 <strong>Go Fishing</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend time casting your line and experience the calm of fishing as you try to catch different kinds of fish. Each attempt brings the excitement of a new catch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/244b7adb0c56e1094584bfd8bddb5399.poster.avif?t=1786616929\" width=\"610\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/244b7adb0c56e1094584bfd8bddb5399.webm?t=1786616929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/244b7adb0c56e1094584bfd8bddb5399.mp4?t=1786616929\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u26cf\ufe0f Mining</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the mines to collect resources that are essential for crafting and upgrading your tools and equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/6c6ee5744ed8345f73cd54cfa484c55b.poster.avif?t=1786616929\" width=\"610\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/6c6ee5744ed8345f73cd54cfa484c55b.webm?t=1786616929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/6c6ee5744ed8345f73cd54cfa484c55b.mp4?t=1786616929\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Discover &amp; Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step outside your farm to stroll through forests, walk along the shore, or visit the bustling city. Take your time to enjoy the changing scenery and atmosphere as you explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/d3fd41506cbec77530ba9a689973cc75.poster.avif?t=1786616929\" width=\"610\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/d3fd41506cbec77530ba9a689973cc75.webm?t=1786616929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/d3fd41506cbec77530ba9a689973cc75.mp4?t=1786616929\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\udd1d <strong>Connect with the Community</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet the townsfolk, each with their own unique personalities and needs. Build lasting friendships, sell goods, and become a valued part of the town\u2019s daily life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/87f3f71ccce27c950afa7428af6e1d3e.poster.avif?t=1786616929\" width=\"610\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/87f3f71ccce27c950afa7428af6e1d3e.webm?t=1786616929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/extras/87f3f71ccce27c950afa7428af6e1d3e.mp4?t=1786616929\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Cultivate crops, care for animals, fish, mine resources, and explore diverse environments while growing the local community. Invite village residents to work with you and collaborate to meet city targets, helping you achieve goals more efficiently.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714180/c3bd608fc72f51f281efff25779072d3d90a61c0/header.jpg?t=1786616929", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Farming Sim", "Life Sim", "Agriculture", "Exploration", "Crafting", "Mining"], "developers": "Cropstone Studio", "publishers": "Cropstone Studio", "release_date": "Aug 13, 2026", "price": "$14.99", "appid": "3714180", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "28 October 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/7gGYXzOfXDE", "first_seen": 1761609600.0, "review_rank": 1434}